flowchart LR
    U[User Dashboard\nQuora Tab] --> FE[Frontend script.js]
    FE --> API[POST /api/quora/scrape]
    API --> JOB[Quora Job Registry\nstatus + logs + cancellation]
    JOB --> QWF[QuoraWorkflow.js]
    QWF --> QS[QuoraScraper.js]

    QS --> BROWSER[Puppeteer + Stealth Browser]
    BROWSER --> COOKIES[Quora Cookies from .env]
    BROWSER --> LOGIN[Login-Wall Detection]

    QS --> EXPAND[Expand Hidden/Collapsed Content]
    QS --> DOM[Dynamic DOM Extraction\nauthor + title + content + upvotes]
    QS --> SCROLL[Iterative Scroll\nStability/No-New Detection]
    QS --> LINKS[Related Link Fan-out]

    QS --> LIMITS[Depth + Max URLs + Duration Cap]
    QS --> CANCEL[Cancellation Checkpoints]
    QS --> RESTART[Periodic Browser Restart]

    DOM --> DATA[Normalized Quora Records]
    EXPAND --> DATA
    LINKS --> DATA

    DATA --> QWF
    QWF --> TX[Transactional Insert]
    TX --> DB[(SQLite\nquora_jobs + quora_results)]

    JOB --> SSE[SSE /api/quora/status]
    SSE --> FE
    DB --> FE

    FE --> STOP[DELETE /api/quora/jobs/:id/cancel]
    STOP --> JOB
